---
title: Test - Browse Artifact List Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Content Panel
    participant HTTP as Artifact Client
    participant API as Artifact API (Server)

    Dev->>CP: Opens content panel / refreshes
    CP->>HTTP: listArtifacts()
    HTTP->>API: GET /artifacts
    API-->>HTTP: ArtifactEntry[] (path, type, size)
    Note right of API: assert response is array (empty OK if no .dingllm/)
    Note right of API: assert each entry has path, type, size
    Note right of API: assert type is one of: md, mmd, txt

    HTTP-->>CP: ArtifactEntry[]
    CP->>Dev: Render artifact list grouped by directory
    Note right of CP: assert list item count matches response length
    Note right of CP: assert entries grouped by parent directory
    Note right of CP: assert each item is clickable
